  "worked_solution": "If we substitute $c=-1$ into the given equation, we get a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3-c & =4 \\\\ 3-(-1) & =4 \\\\ 3+1 & =4 \\\\ 4 & =4\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $c=-1.$",
